The context for the scene is that Shirou Emiya, a highschool student and mediocre mage, ends up as a target for elimination during a Holy Grail War (a war between mages and their summoned servants), because of his potential to become one of the competitors. However, he accidentally ends up summoning a servant in the middle of being attacked, and the summoned spirit (referred to by their battle class "Saber", even though their real identity is
Arthur Pendragon, the mythical King of England
). This scene is their first meeting upon summoning, in which Saber asks him if he is her master.
